---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Achievements & Contributions | Arman Mishra" description="CTF achievements, independent vulnerability research, and CTF challenge development by Arman Mishra.">
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">FIELD EXPERIENCE / RECOGNITION</div>
    <h1>Work beyond the coursework<span class="hero-accent">Research. Build. Contribute.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">A record of independent vulnerability research, competition achievements, and technical contributions to hands-on security challenges.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="container section timeline">
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <span class="timeline-number">Competitions</span>
      <h2>CTF victories</h2>
      <p>Nine CTF wins, including five at national competitions, as recorded in my competition history.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <span class="timeline-number">Independent research</span>
      <h2>Vulnerability disclosure & bug bounty</h2>
      <p>Independently identified, validated, and reported vulnerabilities through disclosure and bug bounty programmes, including findings that resulted in paid awards.</p>
      <p class="small-note">Public case studies will be limited to disclosures that are safe to publish and do not expose confidential programme or target information.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <span class="timeline-number">CTF engineering</span>
      <h2>Script Jackers × Ginius Cyber Security Council</h2>
      <p>Contributed to the creation and development of the HackVerse CTF platform. Challenge work included forensic challenges at Medium, Hard, and Extreme difficulty, as well as boot-to-root boxes at Easy, Medium, and Hard difficulty spanning web and network concepts.</p>
      <p>Received an appreciation letter from Ginius Cyber Security Council recognizing the contribution to HackVerse.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/documents/GCS_HackVerse_Appreciation_Letter.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View appreciation letter <span>↗</span></a>
    </article>
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <span class="timeline-number">Practical testing</span>
      <h2>CPTS & Hack The Box environments</h2>
      <p>Hands-on practice across web, network, Windows, Linux, and Active Directory environments, including enumeration, exploitation, privilege escalation, lateral movement, and pivoting.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore selected projects <span>↗</span></a>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
